    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/e683a053a485eedf4cec9ae2f8989908.avif?t=1682351063\" /></div><br>Remote Planets is a cute, relaxing puzzle game set in a mysterious alien galaxy. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/193e7723625bc954978613fc34fe0ad4.poster.avif?t=1682351063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/193e7723625bc954978613fc34fe0ad4.webm?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/193e7723625bc954978613fc34fe0ad4.mp4?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/52953707138949c74855b2aaf49da321.avif?t=1682351063\" /></div><br>Explore the colorful world, solve logic challenges using unique mechanics and help the friendly cast of villagers restore power to their homes. Reshape the level space with the help of mysterious alien technology. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d7883b3ac5a2fac6480739f0cdb7cf20.poster.avif?t=1682351063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d7883b3ac5a2fac6480739f0cdb7cf20.webm?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d7883b3ac5a2fac6480739f0cdb7cf20.mp4?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/840ebb66f5d39bd0cca232fd0c261319.avif?t=1682351063\" /></div><br>The game contains:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> over 120 challenging hand-crafted puzzles<br></li><li> multiple unique mechanics blending together<br></li><li> a colorful, welcoming alien world<br></li><li> a cast of funny, friendly characters <br></li><li> a relaxing, chill ambient soundtrack</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d9dbea7149aab2d783329a9632703ffa.poster.avif?t=1682351063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d9dbea7149aab2d783329a9632703ffa.webm?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197020/extras/d9dbea7149aab2d783329a9632703ffa.mp4?t=1682351063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
